SUMMARY:Thanksgiving Turkey Trot
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Runners\nIt's time again for the annual downtown Ash
 eville Turkey Trot! Come get your Thanksgiving started with a bang! The ru
 n is great but the afterparty is legendary! Hosted by Adam\, Robin\, Seth\
 , andd Tammy.\n\nCome join us as we meet pre-race for some pictures and to
  give each other encouragement 8:55 in front of packs tavern. We will then
  walk over to race start. Post race we will be having our usual hottie tod
 dy and snacks to kick off the thanksgiving day celebration. Please registe
 r for the race at this link:\n\nhttps://www.ashevilleturkeytrot.com\n\nWe 
 will plan to meet before race at packs tavern (8:55 since race start 9:15)
  and post race in the college street parking garage (we will meet by finis
 h line to gather people however if we don’t see you head over that way p
 ost race).
