  on the Rooftop**✨**\n\n**She Owns It AVL\, AMBIRE Collective**\, and th
 e **Unofficial Connection Hub** are coming together for a night on the roo
 ftop 🥂\n\nYour first glass of bubbles is waiting when you arrive. Come 
 for the music\, stay for the good company\, and meet some amazing women wh
 ile you're up there. 💛\n\nBring a friend or come solo. See you up on th
 e Roof! 💫\n\nThank you for updating your RSVP if your plans shift so an
 other woman can join us.
