UID:b81a78e515bb108d8d1e9877c56acd3e@asheville.com
DESCRIPTION:Cost: Free | Recurring weekly until Thursday\, December 31\, 2
 026. Grab your friends and put your random knowledge to work. Wayward Triv
 ia presents a free night of team trivia every Thursday from 6:30 to 8 p.m.
