X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Amcdance": "https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/317471678/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_amcdance
X-SOURCE:Asheville Movement Collective
UID:event_317471678@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261121T064705Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261213T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261213T123000
SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ Marta Martín
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, December 13th\n1st Dan
 ce Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance
  Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilita
 tor Marta Martín\n\nIntention: TBA\n\n## About Marta Martín\n\nMarta (sh
 e/her/ella) has been part of AMC since she moved to Asheville from Surfsid
 e\, FL in 2008. She has been teaching movement for over 30 years\, using m
 usic and movements from around the world.\nShe loves to motivate people to
  find freedom in their bodies so they can dance to the spirit.\nListen to 
 her mixes on Mixcloud ([https://www.mixcloud.com/DancingMarta/](https://ww
 w.mixcloud.com/DancingMarta/) ) and Soundcloud ([https://soundcloud.com/da
 ncingmarta](https://soundcloud.com/dancingmarta) )\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* 
 Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at 
 Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Please be on ti
 me to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30
  or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registr
 ation Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and danc
 e for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollectiv
 e.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbcli
 d=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOT
 E3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1
 OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will cl
 ose at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OP
 ENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemove
 mentcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our
 -dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX
 2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I
 _3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movem
 ent Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are free 
 to be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission and ai
 m are to inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-form danc
 e by hosting dance waves for personal and community transformation. AMC is
  a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\,
  NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/317471678/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261117T185442Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261117T185442Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
