X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Jackofthewood Events Ics": "https://jackofthewood.com/events/hello-my-dear-2/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:jackofthewood_events_ics
X-SOURCE:Jack of the Wood
UID:12260@jackofthewood.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270108T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270108T233000
DTSTAMP:20261119T020804Z
URL:https://jackofthewood.com/events/hello-my-dear-2/
SUMMARY:Hello My Dear
DESCRIPTION:\nHello My Dear is the acoustic duo of Caitlin Krisko and Aaron
  Austin (of Caitlin Krisko &amp\; the Broadcast)\, delivering soulful\, ro
 ots-driven originals and covers steeped in blues\, Americana\, and classic
  rock. Hello My Dear offers a warm\, high-impact performance that feel bot
 h powerful and deeply personal. Rooted in the songs and spirit that have d
 efined their journey together the duo presents a more stripped-down\, emot
 ionally resonant expression of the music of Caitlin Krisko &amp\; The Broa
 dcast\, alongside carefully curated covers that have shaped their sound. A
 t the heart of Hello My Dear is Caitlin Krisko's unmistakeable voice\, equ
 al parts raw power and ender storytelling\, paired with Aaron Austin's sou
 lful\, dynamic guitar work. Described by Rolling Stones as "one of the bes
 t-kept vocal secrets of the southeast\," Krisko brings the same vocal grav
 ity and emotional honesty that has earned widespread acclaim in the band's
  full electric setting\, translated beautifully into an acoustic format. C
 ome join them for Hello My Dear's performance at Asheville's own\, Jack of
  the Wood. Music 8:30-11:30pm\, $10 cover at the door.\n\n\n\n\nhttps://ww
 w.youtube.com/shorts/KKCCLKqmVlk\n\n\n\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 6/11/hellomydear2.jpg
END:VEVENT
