 ou love a good game with friends\, laughter\, and a little strategy? Come 
 join us forMahjong at the Community Center!No experience? No problem! Begi
 nners and seasoned players are all welcome — we’ll help you learn as y
 ou go.Bring your curiosity\, bring a friend\, and get ready to enjoy one o
 f the world’s most loved games. Let’s shuffle the tiles and start some
 thing fun together!
LOCATION:Multipurpose Room\, Weaverville Community Center\, 60 Lakeshore D
 rive\, Weaverville\, NC
