X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Ncarboretum": "https://ncarboretum.org/event/adult-ed-open-house/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ncarboretum
X-SOURCE:NC Arboretum
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270116T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270116T130000
DTSTAMP:20261120T151729Z
CREATED:20261113T170645Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261120T151729Z
UID:1778780020268-1800093600-1800104400@ncarboretum.org
SUMMARY:Adult and Continuing Education Open House
DESCRIPTION:Adult and Continuing Education Open House\nwith Adult Education Staff \nSaturday\, January 16 | 10 am – 1 pm \nRegister Here!\nJoin Adult Education staff in this informative open house program where interested students can check out the spaces that we use for teaching. We will talk through how to register for classes and show how to navigate our website to see what are classes we have open for registration. Then\, after a quick break\, we will go outside to walk some of the trails that we use in classes and explore the gardens a bit. \nThis program will take place both in the classroom and outdoors. Be prepared to be outside for half of the class time walking on easy\, natural trail surfaces. \n●  See a full listing of Adult Education Programs at the North Carolina Arboretum here! Questions? Check our FAQs. \n●  Follow us on Facebook & Instagram! Or join our Adult Education Student Hub on Discord! \n●  Interested in supporting the NC Arboretum more directly? Donate to the ONE Fund here. \nSee all of our classes open for registration here!
URL:https://ncarboretum.org/event/adult-ed-open-house/
CATEGORIES:Adult Education,BREG,BRN
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncarboretum.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/EndowmentHeader.jpg
END:VEVENT
