X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Asheville.com": "https://www.asheville.com/event/crafting-variance/2027-01-29/", "Hendersonville.com": "https://www.hendersonville.com/event/crafting-variance/2027-01-29/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Asheville.com": "https://www.asheville.com/event/crafting-variance/2027-01-29/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:asheville_com
SUMMARY:Crafting Variance
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270129T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270129T180000
UID:239a55b67936d10c84c533e995f375d2@asheville.com
DESCRIPTION:Recurring daily until Saturday\, May 1\, 2027. What does it me
 an to know and work with a material\, and what happens when makers embrace
  variability? Crafting Variance\, a new exhibition opening at the Center f
 or Craft on Friday\, October 9\, brings together nine US and international
  artists who work with natural\, living\, and discarded materials…
