DESCRIPTION:Come join us at our Downtown AVL Community Meeting held on the
  second Monday of each month. Many of us are frustrated or deeply concerne
 d about what’s happening in our government right now — the erosion of 
 trust\, the lack of accountability\, and the growing sense that our voices
  aren’t being heard. If that resonates with you\, you’re not alone. **
